	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tarda senectus facit, frater in <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Christo observandissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quod tardius sim scribendo<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Non est tamen, quod hinc periculi aliquid vereare, quasi ob hanc <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>negligentiam te vel minus amaverim vel quod sancta tui <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>memoria apud me interciderit; absit hoc a me, qui toties hu<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>manitatem tuam scribendo ac reliquis benefitiis expertus fuerim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Est et alia excusatio: ante aliquot dies redii a thermis, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non quidem alacrior, sed senior, et rediens scribere <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>non potui propter corporis inflammationes pedumque tumorem, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>qui me magis fervet quam unquam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod neglexi, resartiam, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ni terrenum hoc habitaculum minitans occasum conciderit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Hi duo adolescentes, <persName>Iacobus Hohenbuchius</persName> et <persName ref="p1783">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Cellarius</persName> <note type="misc">[der <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>-Korrespondent?]</note>, principis stipendiarii a <placeName ref="l280">Losanensibus</placeName> revocati (quod <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nosti opinor) ob luem pestilenticam, quę illic grassatur, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ad vos mittuntur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quos tibi moecenati theologico (ac <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ecclesię Christi firmissimę basi, id quod per te spiritus Christi et docendo <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et scribendo per omnes ecclesias Germanię, ne dicam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>alias nationes, testatus est) mirum in modum commendo, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ut in sancta disciplina veraque pietate et eruditione sacra <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>instituantur, quod a principe procul dubio accuratius conmis<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Atque ne nescias, quales sint, hisce paucis depingam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Diversia sunt ingenia: <persName ref="p1783">Cellarius</persName> amator, <persName>Hohenbuchius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>excelso spiritu, sacra contemnens iuris prudentiam ambit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Huius malevolentię uterque specimen exhibuit apertissimum, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>de quibus scribere longius importunum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hoc et principe/pi(?) utcunque <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ab iis, qui rerum hic pociuntur, deliniatum est etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Status ecclesię propitii numinis clementia (cui sit gratia in <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>aevum) adhuc inmutatus perstat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Strasburgenses</placeName>, ad quos <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nuperis diebus vectus sum in rheda meritoria, valde <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>trepidant diurnis nocturnisque vigiliis urbem custodientes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>At nunc cessatum, ut audio.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> nunc gravi<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>us quam unquam obsessi se dedere nolunt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Liberator omnium <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>suo tempore venturus electos omnes ad regnum suum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>perpetuum transferet.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis meo nomine fratres omnes <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> et reliquos.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>vos nostri et praecipue <persName>Ulrichus</persName>, scribę vestri frater, qui apud me <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>fuit <placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Gratia Christi vobiscum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> kalendis aug<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>usti 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p1010">Erbi<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>us</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Eximio pietate et doctrina <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>lingero</persName>, ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>theologo pręcipuo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fratrique obser<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>vando<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
